<title>USA: Albuquerque MAFCA, N.M., won by Zions.</title>
<headline>Albuquerque MAFCA, N.M., won by Zions.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions First National Bank said it won $5 million of Albuquerque Metropolitan Arroyo Flood Control Auth., N.M., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.32 percent.</p>
